Native systemd examples, not Docker Compose. Adapt hardcoded paths/users before
installation; do not run alongside containers on the same ports/data. See
../setup.md#native-systemd-examples for requirements and port differences.

1. Backend service: /etc/systemd/system/nodeherder-backend.service
2. Frontend service: /etc/systemd/system/nodeherder-frontend.service
3. Target unit: /etc/systemd/system/nodeherder.target

sudo systemctl daemon-reload
sudo systemctl enable nodeherder.target
sudo systemctl start nodeherder.target
